      'Opening deal: 2-5 player(s), 0 card(s) per player, 2 deck(s), initial visibility face_down.',
      'Opening flow: start in play; current_player may use play_card before round end.',
      'Scoring check: Teams score the point values of all cards they have melded on the table, receive bonuses for burracos (clean or dirty) and for going out, and subtract the values of any cards left in hand. A clean burraco (seven or more natural cards) is worth 200 points, a dirty burraco (seven or more cards including at least one wild card) is worth 100 points, going out (closing) is worth 100 points, and a team that has not taken its pozzetto at the end of the hand loses 100 points. Expected outcome: 2000.',
